step Fly to Stormwind
  zone map 1453
  tip Nethergarde → fly to Stormwind. · By now you should have 25 books = the last reward (Crest of Elucidation, Researcher's Nightlight or Truthseeker's Bow).
  task "Turn in library books" optional
