step Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar
  zone map 1453
  tip The 10 Atal'ai Tablets are glowing stone tablets lying around inside the Sunken Temple. · Two easy ones: once you're in, swim down through the water; when you come up in The Broken Hall, one is on the right and one is under the water. · They respawn every ~7.5 min, and the rest are spread around the balconies, so you'll pick most up on a normal run. · ~7,100 XP.
  complete 1475 "Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar" map 1435 @76.7,51.3
  turnin 1475 "Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar" @69.5,40.4

step Legacy dungeon · once, for points
  zone map 1418
  tip Range 41-51. · Kill Archaedas at the end.
  task "Legacy: Uldaman" optional

